                                                                           'tracheostomy under '
                                                                           'local if the airway is '
                                                                           'critical. Give IV '
                                                                           'antibiotics and often '
                                                                           'steroids. Drain '
                                                                           'surgically when CT '
                                                                           'shows an abscess, the '
